    "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/tarball/v0.0.10",
    "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/zipball/v0.0.10",
    "body": "OpenAgentCore v0.0.10\n\nThis release brings the recent deployment fixes and microsandbox lifecycle work to the published installer.\n\n- Faster hosted startup without waiting for periodic connection scans, and Files requests that wait for Environment initialization within their existing budget.\n- Independent workspace storage, automatic idle suspension, retained memory snapshots and recovery on compatible nodes.\n- More efficient checkpoint archive handling, workspace capacity enforcement and recovery after confirmed compute loss.\n- Initialization budgets that accommodate dependency installation; package PATH preserved in login shells; reconnection after settled initialization uncertainty.\n- A documented source-build installation path and clearer sandbox lifecycle/capacity information in Web.\n\nPre-release installation policy: install this version into a fresh installation directory. In-place migration between distribution releases is not supported. Use the installation and operations guides for setup and data handling.\n\nUse [v0.0.11](https://github.com/MiniMax-AI/OpenAgentCore/releases/tag/v0.0.11) for installation. It also fixes versioned Compose files so Core and Web use matching immutable images instead of floating `latest` defaults.\n"
  },
